00:15:29,420 --> 00:15:33,180
your dear friends may very well
have succeeded in their gambit.

249
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,680
Release her at once!

250
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,840
As long as your stand is in my grasp,

251
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:46,540
I fear you're little more than a
puppet enslaved to my every whim.

252
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:48,137
He's going for a strike.

253
00:15:48,220 --> 00:15:49,337
Brace yourselves, quick!

254
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:50,617
Time is about to...

255
00:15:50,700 --> 00:15:51,580
Huh?

256
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:55,090
Where is he?

257
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,937
Did he forget to murder us first?

258
00:15:58,020 --> 00:15:59,373
Why is he running away?

259
00:15:59,480 --> 00:16:02,517
It's likely we're not at the
top of his list right now.

260
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:05,129
His focus seems to be
on seizing the arrow.

261
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:08,577
It's the only real thing that
matters, and he knows it.

262
00:16:08,660 --> 00:16:09,577
Shoot him, Mista.

263
00:16:09,660 --> 00:16:11,895
He can't be allowed to reach it first.

264
00:16:14,580 --> 00:16:15,817
Pull the damn trigger!

265
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:18,897
A few bullet wounds are nothing
compared to what he will do.

266
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:21,377
I know the problem is.

267
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,517
I've already shot him.

268
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:26,840
I counted fired all six shots.

269
00:16:37,420 --> 00:16:41,917
That bastards messing with time as he's
running if he sees him coming my bullets?

270
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,353
I just can't touch him!

271
00:16:44,000 --> 00:16:44,830
After him!

272
00:16:44,980 --> 00:16:47,098
It's all over if he gets that arrow!

273
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:58,440
That shadow, it must hold the key
to the arrow's imperviousness.

274
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:01,780
Let's see if my theory
proves to be correct.

275
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:05,317
Requiem's shadow always
extends in the direction?

276
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:09,600
Opposing my movements, regardless
of the sun's actual position.

277
00:17:10,380 --> 00:17:12,337
That must mean...

278
00:17:12,420 --> 00:17:17,008
To that man's eyes, the shadow should
appear as if it is stretching toward me.

279
00:17:17,260 --> 00:17:21,800
But to Bucciarati, the shadow is
extending in front of Requiem itself.

280
00:17:22,140 --> 00:17:27,022
In other words, the position of the shadow
depends on the position of the observer.

281
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:30,940
Cretanous Jade, your
powers are no mystery.

282
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:33,920
I understand how you manipulate souls.

283
00:17:34,260 --> 00:17:36,277
Requiem is the silhouette of the soul.

284
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:40,120
To face it is to contend with
the shadow of one's own mind.

285
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,500
Therefore, attacking it is futile.

286
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,744
It's akin to attacking oneself.

287
00:17:44,940 --> 00:17:48,060
If I eliminate this shadow,
the arrow will be mine.

288
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:53,471
Well, then, wherever a shadow treads,
a source of light must also be nearby.

289
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:56,141
He still hasn't gotten the arrow.

290
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:57,339
Go for Brokemista!

291
00:17:58,040 --> 00:18:01,040
The only place it could
be is behind my soul!

292
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:09,441
He struck something behind his
head, yet Requiem suffered the blow.

293
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:10,953
What the hell happened?

294
00:18:12,380 --> 00:18:13,860
You're mine at last.

295
00:18:14,260 --> 00:18:18,700
Behold, the final victor
is I! I don't care.

296
00:18:19,060 --> 00:18:23,477
Even if Diavolo somehow gets his vile
hands on the arrow, the fight goes on.

297
00:18:23,560 --> 00:18:24,795
We'll just improvise.

298
00:18:25,180 --> 00:18:29,717
Lucky for me, the blood he spilled when
he severed my arm is just ordinary matter.

299
00:18:29,800 --> 00:18:31,820
No different from anything else.

300
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:35,480
Now ain't that right, Golden Wind?

301
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:38,720
It's showtime!

302
00:18:39,340 --> 00:18:42,200
What's happening, that damn mongrel?

303
00:18:44,340 --> 00:18:45,600
Not too bad.

304
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:49,040
I gotta catch up with them quick.

305
00:18:51,360 --> 00:18:52,820
Fire again, mister!

306
00:18:52,980 --> 00:18:54,197
Don't let him get too close!

307
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,320
Yeah, I know!

308
00:18:58,100 --> 00:18:58,930
Gotcha!

309
00:18:59,013 --> 00:19:01,517
Bet you didn't predict
that, you freakin' idiot!

310
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,597
Deflect the bullets comin'
at you all you want!

311
00:19:03,680 --> 00:19:06,177
You can't do jack shit
about these other guys!

312
00:19:06,260 --> 00:19:07,320
All right, fellas!

313
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,738
Y 'all flick that baby back to Papa!

314
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,300
He just launched a whole person!

315
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,097
All the way toward the arrow!

316
00:19:20,180 --> 00:19:22,121
So he did predict our trajectory!

317
00:19:22,260 --> 00:19:24,057
He used the body to course correct!

318
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:25,580
Did you truly believe,

319
00:19:25,800 --> 00:19:26,637
even for a moment,

320
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:32,320
that your laughably slow wits could ever
hope to overcome my predictive mastery.

321
00:19:32,740 --> 00:19:37,140
There are no flaws to exploit, as
I'm sure you've recently learned.

322
00:19:37,460 --> 00:19:42,360
However, Bucciarati, you and your
gaggle did manage to make me try.

323
00:19:43,460 --> 00:19:47,820
I never imagined you would be foolish
enough to betray your own Family,

324
00:19:48,100 --> 00:19:52,317
nor did I believe you competent
enough to discover my true identity.

325
00:19:52,400 --> 00:19:57,100
But, I'm grateful this path has led
me to the true power of the arrow.

326
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,580
Fate never fails!

327
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:03,017
A fitting reward for ones who have
conquered the adversity of their past!

328
00:20:03,100 --> 00:20:04,924
Guys, Reload, don't just stare!

329
00:20:05,060 --> 00:20:06,440
We already told you!

330
00:20:06,620 --> 00:20:09,738
That magazine takes us a
little bit longer to refill!

331
00:20:11,200 --> 00:20:12,030
Shit!

332
00:20:12,113 --> 00:20:13,280
We're all gonna die!

333
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:21,760
No, what now?

334
00:20:23,060 --> 00:20:24,260
Spicy lady.

335
00:20:25,540 --> 00:20:26,370
Surprise!

336
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:28,071
You didn't deflect squat.

337
00:20:28,160 --> 00:20:29,336
The bullets bounced.

338
00:20:29,420 --> 00:20:30,380
My secret?

339
00:20:30,620 --> 00:20:32,326
I turned them to chewing gum.

340
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:37,362
They stretched out thin as they flew, but
they clung to your fists the entire time.

341
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:40,800
Then they sprung back to me and threw you.

342
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:44,180
Trish, how long were you awake?

343
00:20:44,380 --> 00:20:46,720
I too will conquer my past.

344
00:20:46,980 --> 00:20:50,340
I refuse to be afraid, to
live in fear of my fate.

345
00:20:50,520 --> 00:20:52,160
I won't run from it.

346
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:55,440
If it gets in my way, then I'll climb.

347
00:20:55,700 --> 00:20:57,053
It's as simple as that.

348
00:20:57,740 --> 00:20:59,340
The arrow! You guys!

349
00:20:59,660 --> 00:21:01,060
It's so damn close!

350
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,580
Holy crap, I almost got it!

351
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:05,260
Kiss my ass, Diablo.

352
00:21:05,740 --> 00:21:07,837
Go ahead and warp time or predict stuff.

353
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:09,137
It won't change a thing.

354
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:11,044
The arrow's coming to me, baby.

355
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:17,280
My dear girl, how I wish I had never
brought you into this wretched world.

356
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:20,120
Seems I've yet to break free of my past.

357
00:21:21,120 --> 00:21:22,400
Curse it, worm.

358
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:25,140
Now, I'm angry!

359
00:21:31,020 --> 00:21:32,740
No, it can't.

360
00:21:37,700 --> 00:21:40,100
What was it you said about fate?

361
00:21:40,360 --> 00:21:42,100
You just climb, am I right?

362
00:21:42,680 --> 00:21:45,180
Well, I hope you like flying instead.

363
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:47,780
There you go.

364
00:21:51,420 --> 00:21:52,250
Trash!

365
00:22:20,800 --> 00:22:22,200
Come on,

366
00:22:22,380 --> 00:22:25,597
I'll see this alive We are the

367
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:29,777
power Who's in the future Cause

368
00:22:29,860 --> 00:22:35,720
we are the fighters Just
fighting for the rise Let's fight

369
00:22:45,560 --> 00:22:47,020
Let's fight

370
00:23:50,340 --> 00:23:51,170
Thank you.
